  * patches/ modifies OpenGMK's own files and adds two small stand-in crates
    (ramen, a window that is not there; udon, taken from
    https://github.com/Adamcake/udon without its audio devices). It is licensed
    as OpenGMK is: under the GNU General Public License, version 2 only
    (GPL-2.0-only). A package this repository builds is therefore a work under
    GPL-2.0-only as a whole; this repository, with the sources it links, is the
    source such a package corresponds to.

  * OpenGMK itself is not part of this repository; it is pinned by commit in
    the extern/OpenGMK submodule. OpenGMK is licensed under the GNU General
    Public License, version 2 only. See https://github.com/OpenGMK/OpenGMK.

The package this repository builds carries the terms of everything inside it;
waterbox/package-licenses.json is what states them, and they travel with the
binary.

